t/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690753","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:57:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4993270-1846651706678881","game_id":"steam-4993270","kind":"announcement","title":"Palisade 0.49: Workshop maps, LAN beta and ally support","summary":"Steam Workshop Publish maps from the editor to the Steam Workshop, subscribe to maps other players made, and play them in Skirmish. A Workshop map shows the creator name Steam reports for it. Map editor Painting, camera controls, undo and saving are faster, and the tools fit smaller windows. New Map shows a thumbnail of the template with its start sites marked. Play in the editor starts the battle directly, without a second briefing. A map's author field is now Credit, and library cards label it","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T18:15:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706678881","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:57:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4993270-1845383656390144","game_id":"steam-4993270","kind":"announcement","title":"Palisade 0.40.2","summary":"Short Naval Landings cost less, based on the sea route. Previews show the quoted cost. Tiny coastal islands have been removed or joined to nearby land; larger rivers and straits remain separate. Attack previews show committed troops. Help explains the 25% share of remaining reserve and independent fronts. Neutral expansion depends on committed troops, reducing the advantage of repeated clicks or splitting forces. Palisades can enclose buildings, and AI realms make better use of defensive walls. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T22:53:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390144","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:57:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4993270-1844751498221360","game_id":"steam-4993270","kind":"announcement","title":"Palisade 0.28.7","summary":"The demo difficulty menu shows Standard, Hardened, and Relentless without clipping at Large interface scale. Impossible stays locked as a full-game preview; completing the demo does not unlock it. W pans the camera up again. Battlefield actions use Q/4 for Naval Landing, E/5 for Cavalry Charge, and R/6 for Palisades. Typing in a text field no longer triggers game shortcuts. Mouse drags can begin over buildings without selecting an upgrade. Releasing nearby without dragging still selects the buil","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T12:39:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498221360","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:57:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4993270-1844115010498006","game_id":"steam-4993270","kind":"announcement","title":"Palisade 0.26.0 - Five Campaigns, Impossible Difficulty, and Wider Wars","summary":"Five campaigns and sixteen battles The full game now spans five campaigns and sixteen scenarios across the Viking Age, Yellow Turban Rebellion, Genpei War, Atlantic voyages, and the formation of the Triple Alliance. Each theatre has its own map identity, historical framing, authored starting positions, objectives, pressure events, and campaign rewards. Rare and Legendary legacies provide more powerful options between battles, while deterministic seeds and saved progression keep every run reprodu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T22:24:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010498006","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:57:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4993270-1842846814456622","game_id":"steam-4993270","kind":"announcement","title":"Visual Overhaul: New UI, Updated Graphics & Trailer","summary":"A living battlefield and rebuilt interface Battle maps now sit on cut parchment above a dark timber table, with retained paper shadows and a clearer separation between the playable world and its surrounding surface. Capitals, settlements, marketplaces, castles, landmarks, and battlefield actions use a consistent family of readable map symbols. Building markers remain legible at every zoom and change their inner symbol at each upgrade tier. Palisades have textured defensive lines and visible brea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T19:39:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814456622","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:57:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4993270-1842212951297739","game_id":"steam-4993270","kind":"announcement","title":"Palisade 0.9.0 - A More Contested World","summary":"Strategic terrain and landmarks on every mapAll 18 shipped maps now contain deterministic Fertile and Resourceful land. Fertile territory accelerates growth while Resourceful territory strengthens Gold income.Every map now selects landmarks from an authored historical pool.Trading sites, mustering grounds, fortified sites, and craft assemblies grant stackable bonuses while occupied.Landmarks now include dedicated capture and loss audio, localized details, grouped HUD bonuses, and AI strategic va","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T17:51:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297739","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:57:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4993270-1840944183775757","game_id":"steam-4993270","kind":"announcement","title":"Palisade 0.3.0 — Supply Lines & Command","summary":"Highlights Supply and isolation — Naval Landings now build visible yards and supply routes. Cut-off territory attacks at half strength and is twice as easy to capture until reconnected; threatened routes can be recovered before they collapse. Capitals matter more — Three upgrade tiers bring stronger defence, wider protection, and 6/8/10-second occupations. Land attacks no longer stall at the old ward delay, while Cavalry and Naval actions still respect Capital protection. Learn by commanding — T","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T04:44:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183775757","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:57:05Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4993270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:31Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:31Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4993270":"2026-10-26T16:01:31Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4993270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:31Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:31Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:31Z"},"4997300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:31Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:31Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:31Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4993270","app_id":4993270,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:15Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"2aae43b5fd36a016ab80745611469ce286ff95587bec704bd1d6a0744565c30d","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info"